# Optional: endpoint the contact form POSTs each enquiry to, in addition
# to always saving it locally (see /admin → Enquiries).
#
# Recommended: a deployed Google Apps Script Web App backed by a Google
# Sheet — every enquiry then lands as a new row in a shared spreadsheet
# in real time, visible across all visitors/devices, with nothing to
# download or merge manually. Setup: see google-apps-script/Code.gs and
# the "Google Sheets integration" section of README.md. The URL looks
# like:
#   https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX/exec
#
# Also works with any other JSON-accepting POST endpoint, e.g.:
#   Formspree:     https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
#   Web3Forms:     https://api.web3forms.com/submit
#   Supabase:      a Supabase Edge Function URL
#
# Leave empty to rely solely on the local (per-browser) Excel backup.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
